            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Apple Silicon (arm64), macOS 14 or later. This release is development-signed and has not been notarized by Apple. macOS may block its first launch.

- Starts supported formats sooner with the native player and uses mpv for MKV and WebM when appropriate.
- Applies the latest seek position when you skip several times in a row.
- Prepares alternate movie and series versions earlier, and plays movies directly from Continue Watching.
- Improves Live TV player controls.
]]></description>
